# MACDART is a PORT, not a fork: this repo tracks only our own code — the build
# scripts, the CMake build, the test harness, and the three VM fixes captured as
# a patch. The Dart 1.24.3 sources are NOT vendored here; they are extracted
# from a reference checkout and patched by macdart/port/extract.sh at build time.
#
# That reference checkout is OWNED, not borrowed: Dart V1 is EOL, so the quarry
# comes from our own byte-verbatim mirror `albanread/dart-v1-sdk` (a snapshot of
# dart-lang/sdk @ 1.24.3), cloned by macdart/port/get-sdk.sh. See that repo's
# PROVENANCE.md. Removing the dependency on dart-lang/sdk staying online is the
# whole point — do not re-point the build at upstream.

# --- The reference quarry (our mirror albanread/dart-v1-sdk @ 1.24.3, ~165MB) -
/sdk/

# --- Extracted upstream sources (regenerated by macdart/port/extract.sh) ------
# These are copies of Dart 1.24.3 + the applied patch; not our code to track.
/macdart/runtime/
/macdart/sdk/
/macdart/tools/
/macdart/LICENSE.dart
/macdart/PATENTS.dart

# --- Build outputs ------------------------------------------------------------
/macdart/build/
/macdart/build-release/
/macdart/build-st/
/macdart/build-st-rel/

# --- Transient test-run logs --------------------------------------------------
/macdart/test/*.txt

# --- Python / harness artifacts (regenerated) ---------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.pyc
# Machine-specific (absolute paths); auto-generated by test/runtests.py.
/macdart/test/.packages

# --- Local settings / OS cruft ------------------------------------------------
.claude/settings.local.json
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
